@startuml
title Note Keeper - Local First / E2E Sync

actor User

participant "Flutter App\nDevice A" as AppA
participant "Auth / Key Manager" as KeyA
database "SQLite\nDevice A" as DbA
participant "CRDT / Sync Engine\nDevice A" as SyncA
participant "Encryption Service\nDevice A" as EncA
participant "Cloud Storage\nGoogle Drive / WebDAV" as Cloud
participant "CRDT / Sync Engine\nDevice B" as SyncB
participant "Encryption Service\nDevice B" as EncB
database "SQLite\nDevice B" as DbB
participant "Flutter App\nDevice B" as AppB

== First Device ==

User -> AppA: First application start
AppA -> KeyA: Generate Master Key
KeyA -> KeyA: Generate 256-bit random key
KeyA -> KeyA: Derive KEK from password\n(Argon2id)
KeyA -> KeyA: Encrypt Master Key\n(AES-256-GCM)
KeyA --> AppA: Master Key

AppA -> DbA: Create local database

== Create / Modify Note ==

User -> AppA: Create / modify note
AppA -> DbA: INSERT / UPDATE note

AppA -> SyncA: Register change
SyncA -> SyncA: Create ChangeSet

SyncA -> EncA: Encrypt ChangeSet
EncA -> EncA: AES-256-GCM
EncA --> SyncA: Encrypted ChangeSet

SyncA -> Cloud: Upload encrypted ChangeSet
Cloud --> SyncA: Upload confirmed

== Offline ==

User -> AppA: Modify note while offline
AppA -> DbA: UPDATE note
AppA -> SyncA: Register change
SyncA -> SyncA: Create ChangeSet
SyncA -> EncA: Encrypt ChangeSet
EncA --> SyncA: Encrypted ChangeSet

note right of SyncA
Changes remain locally
until connectivity is restored
end note

== Second Device ==

User -> AppB: Install / open application
AppB -> KeyA: Request account recovery
User -> KeyA: Enter password

KeyA -> KeyA: Argon2id(password)
KeyA -> KeyA: Derive KEK
KeyA -> Cloud: Download encrypted Master Key
Cloud --> KeyA: Encrypted Master Key

KeyA -> KeyA: Decrypt Master Key
KeyA --> AppB: Master Key

AppB -> DbB: Create local database

== Initial Synchronization ==

AppB -> Cloud: Request encrypted changes
Cloud --> AppB: Encrypted ChangeSets

AppB -> EncB: Decrypt ChangeSets
EncB -> EncB: AES-256-GCM
EncB --> SyncB: Plain ChangeSets

SyncB -> SyncB: Merge changes\n(CRDT)

SyncB -> DbB: Apply merged changes
DbB --> AppB: Updated local database

AppB -> AppB: Display synchronized notes

== Modification on Device B ==

User -> AppB: Modify note
AppB -> DbB: UPDATE note

AppB -> SyncB: Register change
SyncB -> SyncB: Create ChangeSet
SyncB -> EncB: Encrypt ChangeSet
EncB --> SyncB: Encrypted ChangeSet

SyncB -> Cloud: Upload encrypted ChangeSet
Cloud --> SyncB: Upload confirmed

== Device A Synchronization ==

AppA -> Cloud: Request new changes
Cloud --> AppA: Encrypted ChangeSets

AppA -> EncA: Decrypt ChangeSets
EncA --> SyncA: Plain ChangeSets

SyncA -> SyncA: Merge changes\n(CRDT)
SyncA -> DbA: Apply merged changes

DbA --> AppA: Updated notes
AppA -> AppA: Refresh UI

@enduml